    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Creative branding studio founded in 2000 by Paul Austin and Ben Parker (Ravensbourne), London and New York offices. Now part of WPP via a 2021 majority-stake acquisition, operating within The New Standard collective alongside Universal Design Studio and Map Project Office. Reported 55 staff at acquisition time; LinkedIn shows ~69 currently. Studio-level entity: not a person, Autonomy N/A. Core disciplines are brand strategy, identity, graphic design, packaging, digital/web, and spatial/experiential work; clients include Pinterest, LVMH, MoMA, Sonos, Stella McCartney, Fred Perry, Adidas. Current capabilities tag (Graphic design) likely underrepresents scope; see Open Questions.",
